{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"d51813eeb92e52c116e540460191a340affdfe0ba2e16b4df2e89cff219ae65e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["第七印和香炉"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["羔羊揭开第七印的时候，天上寂静约有二刻。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我看见那站在 神面前的七位天使，有七枝号赐给他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["另有一位天使，拿着金香炉来，站在祭坛旁边。有许多香赐给他，要和众圣徒的祈祷一同献在宝座前的金坛上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["那香的烟和众圣徒的祈祷从天使的手中一同升到 神面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使拿着香炉，盛满了坛上的火，倒在地上；随有雷轰、大声、闪电、地震。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["七号"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["拿着七枝号的七位天使就预备要吹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一位天使吹号，就有雹子与火搀着血丢在地上；地的三分之一和树的三分之一被烧了，一切的青草也被烧了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二位天使吹号，就有仿佛火烧着的大山扔在海中；海的三分之一变成血，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["海中的活物死了三分之一，船只也坏了三分之一。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["第三位天使吹号，就有烧着的大星，好像火把从天上落下来，落在江河的三分之一和众水的泉源上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["（这星名叫「茵 」。）众水的三分之一变为茵 ，因水变苦，就死了许多人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["第四位天使吹号，日头的三分之一、月亮的三分之一、星辰的三分之一都被击打，以致日月星的三分之一黑暗了，白昼的三分之一没有光，黑夜也是这样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我又看见一个鹰飞在空中，并听见它大声说：「三位天使要吹那其余的号。你们住在地上的民，祸哉！祸哉！祸哉！」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}